{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"elf_villager","model_identifier":"elf_villager","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# elf_villager\n\nElf villager (A3), citizen or caravan trader, 1.9 m = 68 u (hair to 69).\n\nTall, slender, androgynous elf of Sylvareth: long neck, narrow shoulders, long limbs, very long straight hair to the waist with pointed ears sticking out. Pale grey-green robe-coat to mid-shin with leaf-cut hems and cuffs, silver clasp, white sash with a hanging tail, grey-green leggings and soft boots. Caravan traders wear the satchel at the left hip (strap across the chest). Baseline skeleton and slot names.\n\n- Cubes: 30 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -8.5..8.5, y 0.0..68.8, z -6.0..4.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 69 x 12 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop | slow, calm breathing and look around |\n| `walk` | 1 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.62 | loop |  |\n| `wave` | 1.6 | loop | greeting (trade / talk) |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on the back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 49.8 u/s (1.40 m/s), cycle 1.0 s\n- `run`: 160.0 u/s (4.50 m/s), cycle 0.62 s\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 68, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 47.5, 4)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 51.5, 4)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 57.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 45.5, -4)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7, 30.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10, 38.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 30.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5.5, 37, 2)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5.5, 37, 2)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `satchel` (visible, under slot_hip_l): caravan trader's satchel; hide the group for plain citizens\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `elf_villager_silver.png`: silver hair\n- `elf_villager_gold.png`: pale gold hair\n- `elf_villager_black.png`: black hair\n\n## Notes\n\n- The coat is a short fixed skirt on the hips plus two leaf-hemmed panels on the thighs, so legs never poke through in walk or run.\n- Proportions: legs 34 u (half the height), arms reach mid-thigh, neck 4 u.\n"},"description":"# elf_villager\n\nElf villager (A3), citizen or caravan trader, 1.9 m = 68 u (hair to 69).\n\nTall, slender, androgynous elf of Sylvareth: long neck, narrow shoulders, long limbs, very long straight hair to the waist with pointed ears sticking out. Pale grey-green robe-coat to mid-shin with leaf-cut hems and cuffs, silver clasp, white sash with a hanging tail, grey-green leggings and soft boots. Caravan traders wear the satchel at the left hip (strap across the chest). Baseline skeleton and slot names.\n\n- Cubes: 30 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -8.5..8.5, y 0.0..68.8, z -6.0..4.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 69 x 12 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop | slow, calm breathing and look around |\n| `walk` | 1 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.62 | loop |  |\n| `wave` | 1.6 | loop | greeting (trade / talk) |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on the back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 49.8 u/s (1.40 m/s), cycle 1.0 s\n- `run`: 160.0 u/s (4.50 m/s), cycle 0.62 s\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 68, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 47.5, 4)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 51.5, 4)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 57.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 45.5, -4)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7, 30.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10, 38.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 30.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5.5, 37, 2)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5.5, 37, 2)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `satchel` (visible, under slot_hip_l): caravan trader's satchel; hide the group for plain citizens\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `elf_villager_silver.png`: silver hair\n- `elf_villager_gold.png`: pale gold hair\n- `elf_villager_black.png`: black hair\n\n## Notes\n\n- The coat is a short fixed skirt on the hips plus two leaf-hemmed panels on the thighs, so legs never poke through in walk or run.\n- Proportions: legs 34 u (half the height), arms reach mid-thigh, neck 4 u.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.5,34.0,-2.5],"to":[4.5,38.0,2.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,34.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[75,52,84.0,56.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[107,52,112.0,56.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[84,52,93.0,56.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[112,52,117.0,56.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[11,52,20.0,57.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[20,52,29.0,57.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"154bad45-6f57-5082-8f68-15a0325cc549"},{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.5,38.0,-2.5],"to":[5.5,56.0,2.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,38.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[72,0,83.0,18.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[94,0,99.0,18.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[83,0,94.0,18.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[99,0,104.0,18.0],"texture":